CREATED:20251117T235955Z
DESCRIPTION:Take Chuo Line Nagoya from Kozoji Station\, leaves every 10 min
 \, get off at KANAYAMA STATION (24 min\, 8 stops)\n\n\nWalk 2 min (null)\n\
